{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj54XAkqwpy7rRRLGCdj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its grain weathered by countless seasons. A single iron keyhole glows faintly.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*CLICK.*\n\n*The mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place — one, two, three — each echoing like a heartbeat in a cathedral.*\n\n*The door swings inward on groaning hinges, revealing...*\n\nA corridor of soft golden light stretching endlessly forward. The air that rushes through carries the scent of old books, rain on warm stone, and something you can't name but recognize — like a memory you haven't made yet.\n\n*The door holds itself open. Waiting.*\n\n*It will not wait forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":160,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}